+//! Planned content (roadmap `09`, one kernel group per milestone, each
+//! gated by the Q31↔FPE differential harness):
+//!
+//! - **M4 (FPE-4.1/4.2):** float threshold init (`T_f = E_f·C_RATIO_f`)
+//!   and clip cap with the identical shift/headroom branch logic
+//!   (`docs/fpe/05` §6.3); float two-pass max-envelope spreading for
+//!   thresholds and spread energy, consuming the **tabulated** f64
+//!   factors (`SfbConfig::mask_factors()`/`mask_factors_spr()`, never
+//!   recomputed in float — `docs/fpe/03` §4.3). Tonality is not
+//!   implemented (PNS-gated upstream, absent in Ferrite; FPE-4.3 asserts
+//!   the absence).
+//! - **M5 (FPE-5.1):** float PCM quantization floor with the accumulating
+//!   per-window `energyShift` (start 2m, +16/window, cap 31, sign
+//!   branches), `max(T_f/16, pcm_f·2^(∓shift))` (`docs/fpe/05` §6.4).
+//!   The PCM floor is FDK's absolute floor; no ATH table is invented
+//!   (`docs/fpe/03` §4.5).
